sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Backend
    participant Redis as Redis
    participant Email as Email Service

    U->>FE: "Forgot password?"
    FE->>API: POST /api/auth/forgot-password (email)
    API->>Redis: store reset code (TTL)
    API->>Email: send reset code
    API-->>FE: 200 generic success (no email enumeration)

    U->>FE: Enter code + new password
    FE->>API: POST /api/auth/reset-password
    API->>Redis: validate code
    API->>API: Argon2-hash new password, update user
    API-->>FE: 200 "Password updated"
